		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">DIN-rail power supply, AC input, 24 V DC 1.5 A, 36 W, 35 mm wide</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">Power LED and V ADJ output voltage trimmer on the front; 1 +V and 1 -V output terminals as on the datasheet (parallel screws); terminal order of the symbol is a convention, the physical order depends on the series</elementInformation>
